00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:29.160
And there is no doubt that this is affecting
our understanding of how effectively we are

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:34.360
dealing with corona virus in the United States
in a bunch of different parts.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.780
And the reason why this is just sickening
