difficult to know what's really going on.

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:12.340
So here's the deal and some of these individual
components we've already talked about in the

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:13.340
past.

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:14.340
One example was Georgia.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:18.120
Georgia had reopened really early, started
