00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:58.650
Then we have this other story where the CDC
and 11 different states have been sometimes

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:05.659
combining when they report tests, they're
combining infection and antibody tests, which

00:03:05.659 --> 00:03:11.060
